还是你要承认所有其他你曾对之产生过感情、曾与之约会过的人类，这就是为什么它被称为“旧物”。

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:01.420
It's about the things, the things we keep from previous relationships.
它是关于那些东西，我们从以前的恋爱关系中保留下来的东西。

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:11.800
And I really love the twist in this episode that when we think it's all about the stuff The Ted has been given by various women, and then it turns out Robin has these living, breathing things that represent her previous relationships.
