to please kill me because it starts in 2001 to 2011, New York City starting with the strokes, through Vampire Weekend, LCD Sound System, DFA record, that whole thing.
致《请杀死我》（Please Kill Me），因为它从2001年一直写到2011年，纽约市从The Strokes（洞穴乐队）开始，历经Vampire Weekend（吸血鬼周末）、LCD Soundsystem（液晶声音系统）、DFA唱片，整个这一脉。

00:40:15.944 --> 00:40:27.519
Like everyone thought like this isn't a scene, but she actually showed that there was something, you know, the yeah, yeah, yeah, as in TV on the radio, like there was so much going on in the moment.
就像每个人都觉得这不是一个流派，但她实际上展示了有些东西在发生，你知道的，Yeah Yeah Yeahs乐队，还有TV on the Radio，当时有那么多事情在发生。

00:40:27.519 --> 00:40:32.487
