We're just talking about stuff.
我们就是在闲聊各种杂物。

00:41:29.030 --> 00:41:34.110
Before we go, I could just report in this directly from Kobe Smolders.
在我们离开之前，我可以直接从科比·斯墨德斯（Cobie Smulders）那里得到这个报道。

00:41:34.110 --> 00:41:40.250
My guess is because there's no sound, we were just told where to go physically and made up the words.
我的猜测是因为没有声音，我们当时只是在物理层面上被告知去哪里，然后自己编台词。

